Value INTERFACE (\S+)
Value PHY (down|\*down|\^down|up|up\(s\))
Value PROTOCOL (down|\*down|\^down|up|up\(s\))
Value DESCRIPTION (\S+.*?)

Start
  ^\s*Interface\s+PHY\s+Protocol\s+Description\s*$$ -> Rows
  ^\s*PHY:\s+Physical\s*$$
  ^\s*(?:\*|\^|#|-)down:\s+.*$$
  ^\s*\(\w+\):\s+.*$$
  ^\s*$$
  ^\s*<[A-Za-z0-9_\-\.]+>.*$$
  ^.*>\s*$$
  ^. -> Error

Rows
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${PHY}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s+${DESCRIPTION}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*${INTERFACE}\s+${PHY}\s+${PROTOCOL}\s*$$ -> Record
  ^\s*$$
  ^\s*<[A-Za-z0-9_\-\.]+>.*$$
  ^.*>\s*$$
  ^. -> Error
